@baseUrl = http://localhost:5256

### ============================================================
### Refresh rotation and reuse detection — run top to bottom.
### Re-run from step 1 to start over.
### ============================================================

### 1. Dev sign-in — expect 200 with accessToken and refreshToken
# @name dev
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/dev

### 2. Access token works — expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/works
Authorization: Bearer {{dev.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 3. Refresh — expect 200 with a new pair; the token from step 1 is now revoked
# @name rotated
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{dev.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### 4. Reuse the token from step 1 — expect 401; all of the user's refresh tokens get revoked
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{dev.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### 5. The token from step 3 was revoked by step 4 — expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{rotated.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### ============================================================
### Logout — run after a fresh sign-in
### ============================================================

### 6. Dev sign-in — expect 200
# @name session
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/dev

### 7. Logout — expect 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{session.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### 8. Refresh after logout — expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{session.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### 9. Logout again — expect 204 (idempotent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{session.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### ============================================================
### Errors
### ============================================================

### No token — expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/works

### Garbage token — expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/works
Authorization: Bearer not-a-jwt

### Unknown refresh token — expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "unknown"
}

### Missing refreshToken — expect 400 with refreshToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Invalid Google ID token — expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "not-a-google-token"
}
